      "block_id": "2605.28615_p6_b42",
      "text": "where M is a mask that highlights the regions of the image corresponding to the edited captions, and the\noperator \u2299denotes element-wise multiplication. The mask is generated according to the bounding boxes of\nthe objects involved in the edits, which are obtained from the caption generation and editing pipeline. We set\na smaller weight for the regions not involved in the edits, ensuring that the loss is focused on the relevant\nregions of the image.\n",
