      "font_size": 10.06,
      "font_name": "TeXGyrePagellaX-Regular",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 252,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.28615_p6_b45",
      "text": "Prompt Collection and Image Generation. We collect composition-related captions from various sources,\nincluding: CONPAIR [13], ReasonGen-R1 [53], T2I-R1 [19], T2I-CompBench Test Set [18]. For each collected\ncaption, we generate 2-4 images using Flux.1-dev [22].\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.87,
        592.68,
        542.38,
        629.48
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        283,
