    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.28615_p6_b47",
      "text": "\u2022 Dimension Parsing: We use DeepSeek-V3 [7] to parse the original captions and identify which dimension\nthe caption is referring to (\u201ccolor\u201d, \u201cshape\u201d, \u201ctexture\u201d, \u201cspatial\u201d, \u201caction\u201d, \u201cnumeracy\u201d or \u201cother\u201d). If the\ncaption refer to multiple dimensions, we select one with the following priority (from highest to lowest):\n",
